{'symbol': 'HAL', 'date': '2023-03-29 08:45:00', 'title': "PETROBRAS ACCELERATES DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION WITH HALLIBURTON'S IENERGY® CLOUD", 'text': 'HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HALLIBURTON COMPANY (NYSE: HAL) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT PETROBRAS WILL USE THE LANDMARK IENERGY® DIGITAL PLATFORM TO ADDRESS ITS SUBSURFACE CHALLENGES. THE COMPANIES EXECUTED A CONTRACT THAT GIVES PETROBRAS ACCESS TO THE ENTIRE HALLIBURTON LANDMARK DECISIONSPACE® 365 GEOSCIENCE SUITE INCLUDING CLOUD-BASED, NEXT-GENERATION TECHNOLOGIES LIKE SEISMIC ENGINE, SCALABLE EARTH MODELING, ASSISTED LITHOLOGY INTERPRETATION, DS365.'}